{"id":"cmq9nd1x7000204ic4fxnhzv8","description":"We’ve officially been awarded the honor of hosting the 26th All China Nash Hash, and this isn’t just any hash; it’s happening during Our 40th Anniversary! That’s four decades of chaos, laughter, mud, beer, and unforgettable trails, and we’re ready to throw a celebration worthy of our legendary status. The Dates Are Set October 23rd – October 25th, 2026\nHow to Register Fill out the form by  visiting the YooPay or Shanghai Hash House Harriers website.\nhttps://yoopay.cn/payment/event_new_pay/50337857 https://shanghai-h3.com\n\nACNH2026 Main Events: Friday, Saturday, and Sunday (Oct 23rd-25th)RMB 588/person (Early Bird Price)  Price Includes:\nACNH Registration (Friday Afternoon/Evening)\nPOSH H3 Family Run and Circle (Friday Evening)\nDrunken Dragon H3 Run and Circle (Saturday Afternoon)\nBash and Concert starring RED ZEPPELIN (Saturday Evening)\nShanghai H3 Run and Circle (Sunday Afternoon)\n26th Nash Hash Shirt\nGoodie Bag\n\nRusty Man (Sunday Morning)\nRMB 199/person\nPrice Includes:\nFull English Breakfast and Bloody Mary\nRusty Man Shirt\nTrail and Circle Beer\n\n40th SHH3 Anniversary (Sunday Afternoon)\nRMB 150/person\nPrice Includes:\nShanghai H3 40th Anniversary Banquet at Yu Li Xiang\nSpecial 40th Anniversary Polo Shirt\n\nOther Nash Hash Week Runs\nPudong Full Moon H3 (October 21st, 2026):\nRunners only\nPay upon arrival\n\nDOGS H3 (October 22nd, 2026):\nFamily Run (Men and women both welcome)\nRunners and walkers welcome\nPay upon arrival\nQuestions? Send them our way by contacting us at [redacted]!\nON-ON!","street":null,"cost":"¥588","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
