{"id":"cmq9sog8q001510hnlwb3nrvj","description":"This week we'll be hashing in Gondomar, set by Swing Low, but it's still easy to get to!  \nMeet at Gramido Clube Naval Bus Stop\nWe hash no matter what weather will be\nBring your hashing spirit abd get ready for fun trail in new territory!  ON ON","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sogdm001710hnww0ezuxh","description":"It's Run #22 on the 22nd - what better coincidence! Snake Shagger is challenging himself as a Live Hare, setting Trail on the go in his favorite territory. Expect twists, turns, and plenty of laughs as we chase him through Matosinhos!  Join us for another fun afternoon of running,  mischief, and post-run banter.\n\nON ON","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9soghg001910hnjn38yua7","description":"Hash Run #23!\nYour Virgin Hare, Shaft Erector, is bravely popping his hare cherry for the very first time! So, pull yourself along, get moving, come hash, and give the poor lad some moral (and immoral) support.\n\n\n\nON ON","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sohe1001b10hnr2nlyz9p","description":"Ho ho ho, you festive half-minds! 🎅🎄\nIt’s that magical time of year again — the very first PIH3 Christmas Run! 🍻✨\n\nYour trail-laying elves for this special occasion are none other than our GM Swing Low, who will be gifting you a merry and possibly confusing trail starting from Praceta do Crasto 20, Valadares. 🏃‍♂️🏃‍♀️🧭\n\nExpect festival drinks & snacks waiting for you in the circle 🍷🍪 — because nothing says Christmas like drinking outdoors in questionable weather. Speaking of which: our silly circle game will be ON ON at start point. \n\nSo dust off your Christmas spirit, dress up if you dare 🎄🧣, and sign up to kick off the first round of festive celebration with PIH3! ✨\n\nOn After:\n7.30 PM @ Super Mario Pizza, next to Orferao de Valadares🍝🍷\n\nAs usual:  5€ per head including running materials, drinks & snacks.\n\n\nON ON! 🔔\nPorto Invicta Mismanagement","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9soi2z001d10hnb9dvrdxp","description":"2026 New Year (1st Anniversary) Run\n\nMeet at 2pm at the start when the hashers assemble - plenty of smile, hellos, and stretching (optional).\nOn After will be at Nhac Nhac Italian Restaurant to share our funs !\nSign up for the hash and come enjoy the fun together.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sojc4001f10hn9vs1j1js","description":"Once again, the GM has insisted on laying trail in the very first month of 2026 — and who are we to deny him such pleasure? So naturally, we’re letting it happen.\n\nAs per usual mismanagement, we’ll gather at 2:00pm at the pagoda in Jardim do Morro, with a sharp-ish 2:30pm kick-off.\n\nSign up for the event, lace up your shoes, and come see if you’re worthy of the GM’s trail. Expect confusion, poor decisions, and possibly beer.\n\nSee you there to rise to the challenge!\n\nOn On! 🍺👣","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sojon001h10hnfpnh571m","description":"Hey you lot, On Sec!\n\nIt's time to sniff out another trail - this time in Ovar, south of Gaia.  Drag your lazy carcasses off the couch, lace up those questionable shoes, and pretend it's about  exercise (we all know it's really about the beer.).\n\nWe'll gathering at Largo Serpo Pinto 10, 3880-137 Ovar.  Meet at 2pm with a 2:50pm chalk-off for the optimists.\n \nOur beloved (and slightly unhinged) Swing Low promises an unexpected trail - expected confusion, poor decisions, and at least one \"who thw f**** laid this?\" moment.\n\nRun, drink, laugh, repeat, Weekend sorted.\n\nOn On","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sokje001j10hnjy2krkvg","description":"Mark Sex is dragging you out of  'nowhere' to get those legs pumping before you wine, dine and misbehave with your better(or worse) half.\n\nBecause nothing says romance like sweat, shiggy and questionable life choices.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sokzf001l10hn0vpgfef9","description":"On the final day of this overly romantic month (28th February), Swing Low is dragging you salty lot to the seaside, where you'll be properly exposed to stiff breezes, wild nature, and the unmistakable perfume of the Alantic.\n\nExpect sand, wind, and possibly regret.\n\nMeet : 2pm for 2:30pm kick off\n\nBring a \"friend\" (real or imaginary) to celebrate the last grasp of romantic before we return to unusual questionable life choices.  \nSee breezes, salty air, and suspicious trails await.\n\nON ON👣","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9soli6001n10hnohyjh8l4","description":"Welcome March - Let's Celebrate the First Month of Spring\n\nSpring has arrived, bringing days, warmer breezes, and fresh blooms all around us.  It's the perfect time to step outside, soak in greenery, and enjoy nature at its best.  \n\nCome out, breathe in the fresh spring air, admire the flowers, and make it run to remember with the hash family.  \n\nMeet :  3pm outside Hotel Neya, R. Monchique\nKuck Off:  3:30pm\n\nOn On","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9somko001p10hn9hg864mm","description":"ON ON TO THE NORTH, YOU  GLORIOUS MISFITS.\n\nWe're heading to the North of Porto  - where the air fresher, the Mesieval footpaths, and vinho flow like quetionable decision-making.\n\nThe trailis laid by Major Clanger & Vampire, straight outta the wild, vinho-soaked north of Portugal.\n\nMeet & Start at Casulo Cocoon, Espaco de Integraco do Corpo com a Natureza.\n\nSign up now.  Or don't. But when you hearthe distant echo of 'ONON'!  carries. thro. the northeen hills... you'll know you made the wrong choice.\n\nNORT PORTUGAL AWAITS.  HASH HARD.  DRINK HARDER.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sonxo001r10hn2eut94wb","description":"#LegDayIsBack 🦵\nAfter #HolidayFeastMode 🍗🍰 it’s finally time to remember we have legs.\n\nJoin one brave lady hare 🐇 and the legendary Mark Sex (fitness guru? countryside explorer? nobody knows) as they escape the gym and hit the wild side.\n\n🌿 #ShiggyTrailAdventure\n🦋 #ButterflySpotting\n🐾 #RandomWildlifeWatching\n🥵 #CardioButMakeItNature\n\nBecause nothing says fitness comeback like running through fields questioning your life choices.\n\n#CountrysideWorkout #CaloriesVsNature #PostHolidayRecovery #RunNowRegretLater\n\nSee you at 2pm at the carpark, East side of  Valongo Train Station, for 2:30 pm Start\n\nOn On\nPorto Invicta Mismanagement","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9soovg001t10hnl3602js5","description":"🌞🐾 ON ON you magnificent pack of trail-sniffing legends! 🐾🌞\n\nEarly summer has landed in Porto and Swing Low,  the hare has escaped into the countryside, leaving a scandalous trail for thirsty hounds to chase sunlight, nature, and whatever suspicious creatures dare cross our path.\n\nDrop your boring errands, abandon responsibility, and lace up those questionable running shoes — it’s time to HASH!\n\n📍 Meet: Outdoor Carparks of São Romão Train Station\n🕑 Gather: 14:00 sharp(ish)\n🐇 Hare’s howl: 14:30 — and the madness begins\n\nExpect trails, laughs, questionable navigation, fresh air, and the usual legendary misbehavior.\n\nBring your legs, your lungs, and your best On-On spirit.\n\nOn On! 🍻","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9sop4f001v10hnswzg9nvy","description":"The trail is heading toward thw mighty Atlanta Ocean, where salty sea breeze, luh greenery, and mystery urban corners of Miramar await discovery!\n\nAs usual, meet at 2pm for 2:30pm Start\nVenue: Senhor da Pedra City Park (Look for the two big stone pillars)\n\nOnly 500metre walk from Miramar Train station to the start point.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9soq8u001x10hn0423g6k3","description":"Get  up, stretch your legs, breathe fresh air, and enjoy the countryside flowers.  Swing Low, the hare leads us through. beautiful woodland, towards the seaside, sunshine, and open fields.  \nMeet at 2pm for start at 2:30pm at Metro Espaco Natureza","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmq9soqpr001z10hnc80s19z7","description":"This time, our special visiting hashers will take on the role of hares, putting their trail-setting talents to the test in Parque Oriental, one of Porto’s beautiful green spaces.\n\nCome support our visiting hares by signing up for the event, tackling their trail challenge, and sharing plenty of fun, laughter, and good company along the way. Expect a great opportunity to explore another brilliant Porto garden while enjoying a memorable day with fellow hashers.\n\nHares:                Strout & Doggy\nVenue:               Car park outside Parque Oriental, \nR. Esteiro de Campanhã 58, 4300-174 Porto\nCoordinates:     41.144646, -8.576921📍 \nMeeting Time:  2pm for a start at 2:30pm\n\nOn-On! 🏃🍻🌳","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmqazz7q4002i04la22370t5w","description":"Swim run: Saturday 4 July, 14:00h\n\nThis will be an A to B run. We meet at S-Bahn Mittlerer Landweg. Our hare Bull's Eye is a real gentleman (or... is he?) and already gives endpoint B as U-Bahn Mummelmannsberg. As it is a swim run, you should bring what you need to swim.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
