{"id":"cmr2g2lli0001lchnuav8n00p","description":"When: Monday 14th July, 5:30 pm.\n\nLocation: A Nossa Casa; Directions Below.\n\nHash details: Approx 8km of terrain through countryside and tracks, minimal hills.  No water on trail so if you bring your doggie you’ll need water.   Doggies allowed on trail and in the courtyard of our Casa.\n\nWe should have enough seating for everyone unless we get inundated!\n\nFood will be provided.  Please let Hare’s assistant know if you are coming and if you want feeding.  \nmailto:[redacted] or What’s app 966654936\n\nGoogle Coordinates:  37.12732629325406, -7.925873114086344 also Map below.  \n\nWhen you turn into our lane \"Caminho do Ribeiro das Netas\", after the first house on the left is a field for parking, look for signs and to get into the courtyard of our house go through the gate up the lane 50 m on the right, look for signs. \n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2lpz0003lchn9vq10jh6","description":"As it's World Conservation Day ..... NO FOWLING on the TRAIL!!!!\n\nWHEN: MONDAY 28th JULY, 5.30pm\n\nWHERE: BENAFIM. NEAR TO THE GYM - AS DESCRIBED BELOW\n\nGPS: 37.232840462062775, -8.119846212448438\n\nHARE: DIESEL DYKE \n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\nBRING CHAIRS, PLATES, CUTLERY AND A DRINKING VESSEL.\n\nWOULD APPRECIATE AN EXTRA TABLE - please let the Hare know if you can bring one along\n\nPLEASE TELL THE HARE, DIESEL DYKE THAT YOU WILL BE COMING SO YOU CAN BE FED!!!!! NO LATER THAT SATURDAY, 26TH JULY BY EMAILING [redacted]\n\n\nDIRECTIONS : \n\nFROM WEST:\n\nFROM SILVES ON A124 HEAD TO MESSINES, ALTE DIRECTION OF SALIR. \n\nAS YOU ENTER BENAFIM TAKE A RIGHT AT THE ONLY ROUNDABOUT, 3RD EXIT.  THEN TAKE FIRST LEFT JUST PASSED THE PETROL STATION AND UP THE SIDE OF THE GYM.  \n\nPARK ANYWHERE AROUND HERE. \n\nFROM EAST:\n\nGET TO A124 AND HEAD TOWARDS SALIR PASSING THE RED GODZILLA IN IT’S PRIDE OF PLACE ON THE ROUNDABOUT. \n\nHEAD STRAIGHT UNTIL YOU REACH BENAFIM.\n\nAT THE ROUNDABOUT TURN FIRST LEFT THEN FIRST LEFT JUST PASSED THE PETROL STATION AND UP THE SIDE OF THE GYM. \n\nPARK ANYWHERE AROUND HERE.\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2lug0005lchna7azqg6h","description":"When: Monday 11th August, 5.30pm to leave at 6pm\n\nWhere: Close to Alcaria, see Map link below\n\nMap Link:\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/HtntJoUZd7PhRhgn7?g_st=am\n\nGPS:  37.18717466019682, -8.194136440477857\n\nHare: Skid Marc\n\nInstructions:\n\nBring all your necessary sticks, chairs, plate, cutlery, water!\n\nPlease let the Hare know you are coming by emailing [redacted]\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2lz20007lchnk923a8qq","description":"Run 2158 Details\n\nWhen: Monday 25th August, 5.30pm\n\nWhere: Sao Braqs de Alportal\nThe walk/run is suitable for city wimps. A mix of city and countryside. Some stunning views from above sea level .  \n\nGPS: 37.1567825, -7.8823556\n\nHare: Beep Beep\n\nHareline:  914078174\n\nInstructions:\n\nBring chairs, cutlery and plates for food. \n\nPlease let the Hare know you are coming by calling the Hareline or emailing [redacted], let me know if you like a simple meal or not.\n\nDirections:\n\nFind Sao Bras De Alportel. \n\nFrom west and south find the Circular Norte. \n\nGo east , go straight over, Rotunda das 100 anos. and Rotunda de atleta. \n\nAt the next Rotunda turn right. Parking after ca. 100m on your right. From east (N270) turn right on to Circular Norte. Second Circular turn left. \n\nParking after ca. 100m on your right.\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2m3q0009lchntahp32o3","description":"When: Monday 8th September , 5pm for a 5.30 pm prompt start.\n\nLocation: A Nossa Casa; Bordeira\n\nHash details: Approx 8km of terrain through countryside and tracks, minimal hills.  No water on trail so if you bring your doggie you’ll need water.   Doggies allowed on trail and in the courtyard of our Casa.\n\nWe should have enough seating for everyone unless we get inundated!\n\nFood will be provided.  Please let Hare know if you are coming and if you want feeding by emailing:\n[redacted] or What’s app 966 654 936\n\nGoogle Coordinates:  37.12732629325406, -7.925873114086344\n\nWhen you turn into our lane \"Caminho do Ribeiro das Netas\", after the first house on the left is a field for parking, look for signs and to get into the courtyard of our house go through the gate up the lane 50 m on the right, look for signs. \n\nON ON!\nCyclopath","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2m96000blchngg0sv4ae","description":"When: Monday 22nd September, 5.30pm\n\nWhere: Monte Seco, Loule\n\nGPS: 37.17384905530667, -8.102935271164203\n\nPin to start: \n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/gnxCmf2DrF4Gv69c7?g_st=afm\n\nHare: Just Stu with a little help from his mates!!\n\nInstructions:\n\nPlease email [redacted] to let him know you are coming\n\nPlease bring Sticks, Plates & Cutlery, Chairs\n\nNo Dogs this week, sorry!\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2miu000dlchn96jx6w0u","description":"Algarve HHH Oktoberfest Hash 2025\n\nWhen:  Sunday, 5th October, 13.30 hrs. PROMPT!\n\nWhere:\nCasa Lontra Bosque\nPalmeiros, Salir.\n8100-189 Loulé\n\nFor real navigators:\nN 37 deg.13’, 50”\nW 08 deg. 01’,33”\n\nFor stupid Tom-toms and Google Maps :\nN 37.230\nW 08.025\n\nHareline: [redacted] (jan) [redacted] (otter)\n(No answer-phone service available on either line)\n\nEmail: [redacted]\n\nPoint of interest for those who are new to AHHH, Oktoberfest hashes go like this:\n\n1. You HAF to dress up! Zat ist ein order! Herren Hashers are expekted to vear shorts or three-quarter length pants (unless they really own a pair of Lederhosen!) with braces or a waistcoat, a checkered shirt and a wide-brimmed hat (available at all good Chinese Teutonic haberdashers) with a feather in it. Damen Harriets, should they not already possess a dirndl dress, wear pretty gingham (or similar) dresses with aprons or ‘pinnies’ and put their hair in pigtails. Zere vill be a prize for ze best dressed Bavarian.\n2. The whole event has an Oktoberfest theme. Beir will be German, snacks and food will be German, the singing will be German, and the humour will be . . . vell, jokes about why ze Swedes haf no sense of humour. . . ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!\n3. Other than that, it’s just a normal hash.\n4. Oh. Und Dogs ist verboten! Sorry, Fido, but for you ze Hash ist over!\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\nIf you want to eat, call or email Herr Hare BEFORE HE GETS PISSED ON FRIDAY EVENING.  If you don’t you will starve to death in a Stalag!\n\nHare: (Just don’t call me) Shurely: 966 554 974.\nHare’s Bitch: Diesel Dyke. Al fresco telephone number: 961 481 309\nEmail: [redacted]\n\nPlease bring your own plates, cutlery and drinking vessels!\n\nDIRECTIONS:\n\n From the Western Algarve: Come off the N-125 or the A22 at Boliqueime and take the EN270, Loulé, road (north) up into the hills past a quarry. About 250 metres after the quarry\nthere is a road junction signposted ‘Alte, Befafim and Parragil’. Turn left here. Follow the road for a kilome","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2mog000flchngj57kwjg","description":"Dear Hashers,\n\nAs is Tradition,  we will be supporting the Mamamaratona again this year on Sunday 19th October.\n\nAll details of how to Register are on the website, see link below.\n\nMamamaratona AOA website - Algarve Oncology Association https://share.google/0bIHAyTyL0xGldgGY\n\nWe will be going for lunch afterwards, venue and prices to be confirmed.\n\nIn the first instance, if you wish to join in, please Register.\n\nHave you registered yet for the Mamamaratona??  Lovely Pink T Shirts this year, Knob Nailer & I have ours already!!\n\nAs in previous years the run/walk starts from Passeio das Dunas, Quarteira at 10AM.\nGPS: 37.07104036202333, -8.1110487029957\nGoogle Map Link:\nhttps://www.google.com/maps/place/Passeio+das+Dunas/@37.0704327,-8.1094375,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0xd1ab51ef4125e97:0x7286a3524dc52482!8m2!3d37.0708435!4d-8.1110487!16s%2Fg%2F11gk8tp3hz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAwNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\n\nAfter the Hash we will be going for lunch at Sol e Sombra Restaurant which is a drive out of Quarteira towards Loule (past Vila Sol Golf Course, and just before Aquashow Water Park).\nGPS: 37.09044121272183, -8.074869056965506\nGoogle Map Link:\nhttps://www.google.com/maps/place/Restaurante-Bar+Sol+e+Sombra/@37.0903514,-8.0775727,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0xd1ab4393f04d19b:0x1d37e3bbab6c5fd2!8m2!3d37.0903471!4d-8.0749978!16s%2Fg%2F11b908_hs2?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAwNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\n\nSubs will be €5 for those only doing the Mamamaratona and not joining for lunch.\n\nIf you are joining for lunch subs will be as follows:\n\n€7 for a Vegetarian Meal\n€10 for Grilled Chicken\n€15 for Grilled Fish\n\nSo all you need to do now is email the GM, Diesel Dyke on [redacted] to let her know:\n1.  If you are coming\n2.  If you are lunching?\n3.  If you are a Vegetable, a Chicken or a Fish!!\n\nLooking forward to seeing you all there.\nCNAT","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2mt6000hlchnwxm237lm","description":"Summer Cummer presents AHHH Run 2163 'Day of the Dead-ly hangover'.  Yes!, bring out your dead and clear your head with beautiful, dusty trails that lead us to visual treats and a welcome hair of the dog (or two). Enjoy a delightful, Sunday morning ball-buster, full of blisters and shiggy, all carefully crafted to clear even the worst of hangovers!  If you're looking for a shitty trail, this is the one! Join the real deal team of the AHHH where men are men and the women are err, largely in charge.\n\n\nWhen: Sunday Nov 2nd,  11.30AM for 12.00pm\n\nWhere:  Turn off the road for the Marina in Albufeira.  \nGet into the right lane and pass the Shell garage on your right.  At the bottom of the road turn right and pass the steak restaurant on your left. You will pass a small bus stop on your left. \nAfter a few metres more you will see a left turn (before a zebra crossing) Note: There is a sign on the right that points to the 'Clube Pesca e Nautica Desportiva'. Turn left here.  \nNotice there are some bins on the left side of the road. Just before the bins there is a path. You will turn left here to the Hash site.  Since you cannot cross the road (observe the no entry sign!) you must first go around the landscaped island and turn back... Obviously the entrance to the Hash is now on your right. \nFollow this road to the end. \nAs you will note, there is an enormous amount of parking available. You can choose to park your car anywhere you like in this general area because it is possible to walk down the path to the site.\n\nPark your car (or arse) west of the marina in or around:\n\nGPS: 37.0842896,-8.2696156\n\nWhat Three Words ///bashful.curbed.proof\n\nGoogle Maps https://goo.gl/maps/SFiDWEQPQVvHsQRC6   Note:  The map is well old!  What appears to be wasteground is now a wasted opportunity of a giant, grey plinth.  \n\nHare: Summer Cummer\n\nHareline:  Lost? Nobody cares...but if the hare is sober (not much chance) you could try the 'we don't give a damn' helpline -  918 398 864\n\nMost Import","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2myu000jlchn3pf6sebb","description":"When: Sunday 16th November, 2pm\n\nWhere: Casa Tranquila, Belmonte, Luz de Tavira\n\nGPS: 37.092192278396034, -7.734375535367115\n\nGoogle Map Link:\n\nhttps://www.google.pt/maps/place/Casa+Tranquila/@37.0920794,-7.7369724,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0xd1001256baea09d:0x27e9047c71573d9f!8m2!3d37.0920751!4d-7.7343975!16s%2Fg%2F11hqd07dp0?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDIyNi4xIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\n\nInstructions:  \n\nPlease email the Hare on [redacted] to let him know that you are coming and also if you will be running.\n\nBring Plates & Cutlery.\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2n48000llchn8yd7wuv4","description":"Run 2165 - Santa Catarina da Fonte do Bispo\n\nHare: Comes Too Much\n\nWhen: Sunday 30th November, leaving at 2pm prompt, so come earlier to pay subs and have a Beer!!\n\nWhere: PLEASE NOTE  START HAS MOVED from the Olive Oil Bottling Co. to Jardin de Santa Catarina (behind the tall silos on the main road).  \n\nGPS:37.153871, -7.785994\n\nGoogle Map link:\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/8KNCZStwL9dMEEbU8?g_st=iw\n\nInstructions:  Email the Hare at [redacted] to let him know you are coming and also if you will be eating.\n\nBring Plates & Cutlery.\n\nChuck in a chair and your sticks if you need them  just in case!!\n\nBring the correct change for subs, as we have no change in the tin!!\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2n8z000nlchng0h1w4lp","description":"Dear Hashers,\n\nAs you know the Xmas Hash will be on Saturday 13th December.\n\nWe will meet at 10am for Mulled Wine & Stollen & Bucks Fizz, to set off on trail at 10.30am.\n\nMeet and Park (& Circle) will be here which is a car park at the end of the Street, near to the Escola de Santo Antonio in Loule.  You can access this car Park from two sides, from the school, or from the Road opposite the Rusty Wrench.\n\nGPS: 37.14090003723045, -8.029135197711426\n\nThe easiest way to find it, is to come into Loule from the N125 or A22 up the N396.  \n\nCarry on passed Lidl on the RHS and Wok Loule on the Left, until the next roundabout with the BP Garage on your left hand side.\n\nTake the 3rd Exit from this roundabout onto Rua Marcal Aboim, straight on at the next little roundabout, passed Continenete (Modelo) on your LHS, passed McDonalds on your RHS, and after McDonalds take the next Right onto Rua Fernando Laginha.  Carry on to the end of this road and just before the wall, turn left into the Car Park as per the picture.\n\nAfter the truly marvellous trail, set by our regular Xmas Elves, Beep Beep & Breaking Glass, we have a delicious Indian Buffet at The Saffron Mantra Indian Restaurant, which is a short stroll from the Car Park.\n\nhttps://share.google/7Z7rCbX1ZQVO6gsWx\n\n\nThe Cost of all these Festivities, including lunch, will be €20 for Regular Hashers and €30 for Visitors and non Regular Hashers (ie. all those who haven't set a trail in 2025, or have their names down to do so in the 1st quarter of 2026).\n\nXmas Outfits are compulosory, even if it is only a Santa Hat!!\n\nWe need to give numbers to the Restuarant by Saturday 6th December, so please can all Hashers wishing to attend, please email [redacted] ASAP!\n\nThis Hash is always a highlight of the AHHH Calendar and we look forward to seeing you all there!\n\nOn On!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2ndj000plchnapam175m","description":"Happy New Beer to you all!!  🎊🐇👣🧨👣  \n\nDetails below for the AHHH first hash of 2026!\n\nWhen: Sunday 11th January, meet 10.45 for an 11am start\n\nWhere: Fuseta\n\nGoogle co-ordinates      37.05248,-7.74400\n\nHare: Methane (& Winkle)\n\nInstructions:\n\nPlease bring the correct change for Hash Cash, which for this week will be €5 as the On In Food is at a local Restaurant paid for by each Hasher (see Menu and picture of the Restaurant also attached), it will be about €20 for an all inclusive lunch.\n\nThe Restaurant needs an idea of numbers so let Methane know:\na) Are you Hashing?\nb) Are you eating?\nBy emailing [redacted]\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2nik000rlchnh7vfeab0","description":"When:  Sunday 08.02.2026\n\nTime:  14 O’clock or 2,00 pm\n\nLocation:  Fonte Ferrea , Alportel\n\nCoordinates:  37°11‘06.0“N 7°54‘50.4“W\n\nHare: Beep Beep\n\nHelpline:  914 078 174\n\nDirections:\n\nFind your way to Sao Bras de Alportel and the Estrada N2.\n\nDrive north (ignore the deviation signs to Almodovar) bypass Alportel and find the way to Fonte Ferrea on your right after the first accending of the N2.\n\nInstructions:\n\nBring the usual stuff you are requested to bring for HOT (warm and spicy)soup after the circle.\n\nPlease let Beep Berp know if you are attending by emailing [redacted] \n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
