{"id":"cmr2g2nrm000vlchnfw110hcy","description":"When: Sunday22nd March 2pm\n\nHare: Lord Exoshite (& El Cheapo)\n\nWhere: Somewhere north of Alcantarilha Gare\n\nGoogle Co-Ordinates:  37.177577, -8.351491\n\nMeeting-Point: A Nossa Cassa\n\nInstructions:\n\nPlease email the Hare on [redacted] or sms 916976074 to let them know you are coming by midday Friday 20th.\n\nPlease bring your own plate and cutlery.\n\nChuck in a Chair too!\n\n\nDirections:\n\nFrom the EN 125 or A22 head towards Algoz.\n\nTake the Algoz road towards Silves.\n\nAfter two sets of speed control lights turn right over the railway line at Alcantarilha Gare Station.\n\nKeep on this road for approx 1km.\n\nThe house is on the left. A Nossa Casa.\n\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2nwd000xlchnk9zrn4j1","description":"When: Sunday 5th April 11AM\n\nWhere: KSSJ's House, Alportel and afterwards at the Sports Club, Sociedade Alportelense\n\nHare: King Sir Sir James\n\nHareline:  [redacted]\n\nGPS: To the Below area at the end of KSSJ's road:\n37.17598700956264, -7.909047553798213\n\nInstructions:\n\nPlease let the Hare know you are coming so he can give numbers to the Restaurant by email to [redacted]\n\nSubs will be €5.  Each Hasher pays for their own Lunch after the Hash.\n\nAs it is Easter Sunday, Easter themed costumes and/or Easter Bonnets are compulsory and there will be a prize for the best!\n\nDirections:\n\nHead up the N2 towards Alportel.\n\nWhen you reach Cafe Victoria on left hand side, on the N2 at Alportel, take the right hand fork into Alportel, signposted Alportel, Aldeias Tradicionais, Javali, Parises etc.\n\nPark anywhere you can near the Church, the Sports Club, near to the GPS Co-Ords above.  Do not drive to the House as you won't be able to park!!  Only enough room for the Beer Truck.  \n\nIt is a short 5 minute walk to the Hare's house from the village centre, and there will be flour arrows to guide you there!\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2o1e000zlchng585tdwm","description":"When:  Sunday 19th April, 2pm\n\n\nWhere: Parking @ The Pego do Inferno\n\n\nGPS Location:  37°09'27.0\"N 7°41'57.0\"W or 37.15731853299864, -7.699467039874303\n\n\nGoogle Maps:  https://maps.app.goo.gl/ih2Yn7rpWhGZvFAm8?g_st=iw\n\n\nHare:  Tight Lips\n\n\nHareline:  927 769 028  (in case/when you get lost).\n\n\nInstructions:  \n\n\nBring Chairs if you want to sit and bring plate/cutlery if you want to eat afterwards.  Dinner will be provided by the Hare.\n\n\nPlease confirm attendance with Hare by Friday 17th by emailing  [redacted]\n \n\nDirections:  \n\n\nTake the A22 to Tavira and exit at the Tavira junction.  \n\n\nTurn 3rd right at the roundabout towards Santa Margarida.  This is the turning AFTER Tavira.  \n\n\nTurn left after 500m onto Rua Barranco da Nora.\n\n\nGo under the A22 and keep going straight.\n  \n\nOn On!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2o5r0011lchn3odxluvb","description":"When: Sunday 3rd May  2pm\n\nWhere: A Nossa Casa; Bordeira\n\nGoogle Coordinates:  37.12732629325406, -7.925873114086344\n\nHare: Dope Peddlar\n\nInstructions: \n\nApprox 8km of terrain through countryside and tracks, minimal hills.  No water on trail so if you bring your doggie you’ll need water.   Doggies allowed on trail and in the courtyard of our Casa.\n\nWe should have enough seating for everyone unless we get inundated!\n\nFood will be provided.  Please let Hare know if you are coming and if you want feeding by emailing:\n[redacted] or What’s app 966 654 936\n\nDirections:\n\nWhen you turn into our lane \"Caminho do Ribeiro das Netas\", after the first house on the left is a field for parking, look for signs.\n\nOnce parked, to get into the courtyard of our house go through the gate up the lane 50 m on the right, look for signs. \n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2oan0013lchn9e6n7jck","description":"When:  Sunday 17th May 2026\n\nTime:  14 o’clock or 2pm\n\nLocation:  Hares House Juncais\n\nCoordinates:  37.175666,-7.9161939 or 37•10‘32.4“N    7•54’58.3“W\n\nHare: Beep Beep\n\nHelpline:  914 078 174\n\nDirections:\n\nFind your way to Sao Bras de Alportel and the Estrada N2.\nDrive north (ignore the deviation signs to Almodovar).\n\nAt Cafe Victoria in Alportel drive straight (leave the N2) into the Center. Turn left underpass through the tunnel the N2 and proceed to Juncais. The house is on your right side. No 849A.\n\nInstructions:\n\nBring the usual stuff you are requested to bring for HOT (warm and spicy)soup after the circle.\n\nThe trail is easy considering the poor condition of the Hare.\n\nPlease let Beep Beep know if you are attending by emailing [redacted] \n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2ofu0015lchnwfy4gbxr","description":"When:  Sunday 31st May, 10am start\n\nWhere:  Salir, behind the Tourist Information Office on the high street\n\nGoogle Co-Ordinates: 37.1430 / -8.0250  (37°14'30\"N 8°02'50\"W)\n\nHare: Comes Now and Then\n\nHareline:  926 000 673\n\nInstructions:\n\nBring sticks (for some uppy downys!!!)\nBring Water - it's HOT HOT HOT!!\n\"Don't forget your Sunscreen\"\n\nThe On After will be at Restaurant a Villa, on the High Street in Salir.  It will be €20 p.p.\n\nThis will include Couvert, 1/2 Jug Wine p.p. or a Pint of Beer, Soft drinks, Water and a choice of Mains:\n\nGrilled Chicken on the bone & Chips\nGrilled Chicken Breast & Chips\nPork Cheeks with Potatoes \nMushroom & Spinach Risotto\nGoats Cheese, Tomato & Artichoke Salad \n\nPlease let CNAT know if you are coming and staying for lunch, with your choice of Mains, by replying to this email, or SMS or Whatsapp 926 000 673.  Or use the AHHH page on the Hashing in Portugal Whatsapp group.\n\nDirections:\n\nFrom the N125:\n\nFrom the Loule/Quarteira roundabout on the N125 take the dual carriageway towards Loule N396. \nTake the  exit signposted N270 S. Bras/Boliqueime/Zona Industrial and at the top of the slip  road turn right and you will come to a roundabout where you will go all the way around and come back on yourself, signposted N270 S.Bras/Boliqueime/Zona Industrial.\nAt the next roundabout go straight over and join the new Loule by pass you should see a brown Alte/Salir sign, go straight across the next roundabout following the brown Alte/Salir sign and at the next roundabout take the 3rd exit to Salir.\nStay on this road for 11.9kms all the way to Salir. The only major intersection you will come to is at the Tor traffic lights over a river bridge, you will go straight ahead here passing through Andrezes, Mesquita & as you enter Alto Fica you will see Salir perched on a hill on your right.\n\nFrom the West:\n\nAt the Boliqueime roundabout, take the 3rd exit towards Loule.\n\nWith ALDI on your left go up the road through some traffic lights, just before the A2","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2ol10017lchnbtu7eqco","description":"Run 2176 \n\nWhen: Sunday 14th June\n\n\nHash start time : 9:30 meet & drinks, 10am circle up and on on\n\n\nWhere: Fonte Filipe, Amendoeira, Loule\n\n\nGoogle Maps:  https://maps.app.goo.gl/tvv3Pytnh48CMgN16?g_st=in\n\n\n37°10'50.9\"N 7°57'47.4\"W\n\n\nGoogle co- ordinates:\n\n\n37.1808105, -7.9631691\n\n\nHare: All The Way\n\n\nHareline: [redacted]\n\n\nInstructions:\n\nBring sticks if you need them. \n\nIt’s going to be a scorcher, bring hat and sunscreen.  \n\nThere’s the slight possibility of water crossing. Bring a change of footwear if you like dry feet.\n\nThe on after will be at the restaurante de Querenca about 6 mins away.  Menu for the Restaurant is attached.\n\n\nLet the Hare know if you are coming, eating and what you want as a main course by Friday 12th June midday please by Whatsapp or by emailing [redacted].  Subs will be €5, everyone pays for their own lunch and drinks etc.\n\nDirections to the start:\n\nFind Loule on a map. Drive through or round Loule onto the N396 and go north about 4 kms in the direction of Querenca and Barranco do Velho. Turn right onto Rua de Carvalhal. Stay on this road. After about 3kms  go straight across the crossroad, signposted Almarjao and Fonte Filipe. Don’t turn off to Moinho do Vento.  After half a kilometre turn right. After 200 to 300 metres you will arrive at Fonte Filipe. Park up .\n\nThe On After Restaurant is in the centre of Querenca next to the Main Church, maps, co-ords etc below:\n\nGoogle Maps\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/FK3QDsDCcP9r9j8o7?g_st=i\n\n\n37°11'57.6\"N 7°59'14.3\"W\n\nGoogle co-ordinates \n\n\n37.1993350, -7.9872973\n\nON ON!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g2oqf0019lchnd1kayujp","description":"When : Sunday 28th June \n\n\nHash start time : 9:30 drinks, 10am circle up and on on\n\n\nWhere: Lidl Loule\n\nhttps://mail.google.com/mail/?ui=2&ik=23b669be65&attid=0.1&th=19eeeaa00f3ab178&view=fimg&fur=ip&rm=19eeeaa00f3ab178&sz=w1600-h1000&attbid=ANGjdJ-iwjREPGLkNNy0b7jhI7wq_vH_LEuAjFLNGmjaBp9f_xGQo8zoxGDsrwKm6tN9xmbiiPFxCB7xQI1q57uXzESW9jNZTZW6fsvonmHCQGzfYGixq6PJqwAdiwE&disp=emb&realattid&zw/downloaded\n\n\n37°08'08.1\"N 8°01'50.7\"W\n\nGoogle co- ordinates: 37.1351527, -8.0307061\n\nOn after: Wok Loule, across the road from Lidl\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/5KpqaMGdPcYs2zvU9?g_st=in\n\n37°08'08.4\"N 8°01'58.0\"W\n\nGoogle co-ordinates: \n\n37.1355751, -8.0329169\n\nHare:  Hurry Curry\n\nHare Line [redacted]\n\nInstructions:\n\nThere may be tarmac, it may seem urban but bring sticks if you need them!!!  \n\nIt’s still warm, bring hat and sunscreen.\n\nLet the hare’s wonderful, charming, glamorous (add any adjectives you might wish to) assistant know if you are coming and / or eating  by Friday 26th June 6 pm please by Whatsapp or by emailing \n[redacted].  \n\nSubs will be €5, everyone pays for their own lunch and drinks from € 17.90 at Wok Loule. Eat as much as you want!! \n\nDirections:\n\n\nA22 - Come off at the N396, junction 12, towards Loule Centro. Carry on up this road for about 3.5 kms.  Turn first right at the roundabout with the Lidl sign. Park up under the shade or on the road at the back of Lidl. \n\nN 125 - Come off at the N396, sign posted Loule and A22. Carry on up this road for about 5.5 kms. Turn first right at the roundabout with the Lidl sign. Park up under the shade or on the road at the back of Lidl. \n\n\nOn On 👣","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g3dhy000h04l559wdek5l","description":"When: Sunday 12th July, 09.30 for 10.00 START!!\n\nWhere: Alagoas, Salir, north of Loule\n\nGPS: To the turn off the main road onto the track 37.237126   -8.009155\n\nFor real navigators:\nN 37 deg.14’, 24” / W 08 deg. 00’, 32”\n\nFor those stupid Tom-tom thingies:\nN 37.24 / W 08.01\n\nHARE: Diesel Dyke\n\nHARELINE: 961 481 309 /  JDCMS 966 554 974\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\nPlease let the Hare know you are coming by emailing [redacted] before the end of Thursday 9th.\n\nBring Sticks, Water receptacle, Sunscreen, Hats, Chairs, Eating Implements inc. plate\n\nDIRECTIONS:\n\nFrom the East or West find Loulé which is located just north of the A-22 motorway.\n\n From either direction: Find, or follow, the Loulé by-pass (ER270) which is variously signposted ‘Boliqueime’ and ‘S. Brás’ depending upon which direction you are coming from.\nOn this, and due north of Loulé, is a roundabout with a huge Municipal Pavilion on the north side and signposts directing you north to ‘Barranco de Velho & Querença’. Take this exit onto the N396 for about seven kilometres. On a very twisty part of this picturesque road you will come around a bend and see a junction with a road off to the left (and uphill) signposted ‘Tôr’\nand ‘Querença’ this is the EM524. Turn off left here.\n\n Follow the EM524 around the north side of Querença for 1.75 kms to Pombal and a junction just after a leafy bar signposted ‘Tôr’, ‘Corcitos’, ‘Salir’ and ‘Alte’. Turn right here onto the EM510.\n\n Follow the EM510 for 5.5 kms to its very end which is a T-junction with the N124. Turn left here toward ‘Salir’ and ‘Alte’.\n\n Drive about 500 metres along the N124, heading west, until, just after a fairly tight right-hand bend, you will see a track branching off right. Very carefully come off the tarmac onto this track. At the time of writing, the left side of the track’s bell-mouth was the smoothest transition.\nAfter this minor drop the track is quite good. There is one small gully to gently cross and one raised bump which would only hinder the likes","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr2g3dk0000l04l5gj76h29i","description":"Next AHHH Run 2180\n\nWhen: Sunday 9th August at 9.30 for 10am start. \nThe run is 8k and mainly flat. \n\nWhere: Algoz, see map & Co-ordinates below\nThe hash starts and finishes very close to Algoz station if anyone feels like coming by train.   \n\nCoordinates: 37.165901, -8.3015\n\nHare: Shitstirrer\n\nHareline: 922230414\n\nDirections: \n\nFind Algoz. From the centre take the EN 264 towards Messines just before the level crossing turn right signposted Escola EB 2,3 just passed a pedestrian crossing, there is a white metal fence on the corner. \nMake sure you get the right school, there are more than 1.\nFrom Messines 1st left after the level crossing.\n\nInstructions:\n\nThe on after is at the Retiro de Caçadors restaurant. A typical good value Portuguese restaurant 10-15€ everybody pays for themselves. \n\nPlease let the hare know if you coming by next Friday in order to reserve a table.\nEmail [redacted] or Text 922230414\n\nOn On!","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
