{"id":"cmr2iwojb00099whnzfumu0p7","description":"ON ON! HUA HIN FULL MOON HASH # (39) 🌕🍻\nCalling all Hounds, Harriers, and Harriettes! It’s time to follow the flour and chase the moon. We’re heading to the hills (or the back streets!) of Soi 102 for a moonlit trail. Whether you’re an FRB (Front Running Bastard) or a dedicated member of the SCB (Short Cutting Bastards), there’s a trail for you!\n📅 WHEN: Sunday, 18th January 2026\n📍 WHERE: Soi 102, Hua Hin (behind MY STYLE CONDO)\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/Po6NNygkr5fLUUUT9\n🕓 TIME: Meet at 4:30 PM | Hare off at 5:00 PM sharp!\nTHE DETAILS: 👣 Trails: Runner and Walker trails provided.\n🍺 The Reward: Ice-cold amber nectar at the Beer Stop and a proper Circle to follow.\n🔦 Essentials: Bring a torch (it’s a Full Moon run, duh!), shiggy-ready shoes, and your sense of humor.\n💰 Hash Cash: (kids drink beer FREE, Wankers 100 baht, Drinkers 200 baht) (Includes beers, water, and snacks).\nDon't be a \"Loon under the Moon\"—get your gear ready for a classic Soi 102 bash!\nOn-On!","street":"31/350, à¸à¸­à¸¢à¹à¸£à¸à¹à¸£à¸µà¸¢à¸à¹à¸¢à¹à¸¡à¸ªà¸°à¸­à¸²à¸","cost":"THB 200","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
