{"id":"cmr3rj38v0001hbhnjetcrt2f","description":"Party & Games Hash\nBrazil Nuts Hash House Harriers (BNH3) is delighted to announce its next trail and *confraternização* party 🎉\nMeet at 13:00, trail starts 13:30.\nAfter trail and circle there’ll be fun & games at the bar.\n\n📍 Meeting point: Bar Delas, Itanhaém. Facing Rio Preto football pitch\n\nHare: MaBouche \nA-A run 🔂\nBag 🎒 drop \nPlenty free parking \nHash cash: R$ 35 for beer 🍺 drinkers/ R$ 10 for soft 💧 drinkers\nHash gear 👕 on sale\nBring a change of footwear\n\n➕You’re welcome to join us all weekend! Stay overnight at Bar Delas guest space (R$150 pp bed, breakfast, meal, bar) or the accommodation of your choice in Itanhaém area.\n🚍 Getting there: Piracicabana buses leave every hour from Jabaquara and take 2 hours to Itanhaém bus station. Uber/99 the last 9km.","street":"Rua Dos Jaras - Estr. Do Rio Preto, 11755-890","cost":"R$35","clear_run":null,"old_title":"#263","title":"Brazil Nuts H3 #263","clear_time":false},
