{"id":"cmr3rk9wj004fjbhnx8xm7qn6","description":"On On:  Seaview Road, Bridge of Don, Aberdeen AB23 8JL\n\nTo get there - turn off Scotstown Road on to Scotstown Gardens at Balgownie Community Centre, and Bowling Club. Their car park is a bit small, so go past them by 50 yards or so, turn the corner on to Seaview Road and the On On car park is on the corner, next to the big pink house.\n\nGooglemaps link:\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/C3SmMqv5cAk2gNA99\n\nWhat 3 Words - return.tower.long\nhttps://w3w.co/return.tower.long","street":"1 Seaview Road, AB23 8JA, AB23 8JL","cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr3rka39004hjbhnlob9b6w7","description":"OnOn: Car park at end of Mill Road, Port Elphinstone.\n\nTake A96 north to Inverurie (Port Elphinstone) roundabout, turn Right to Inverurie (B993). Turn right after BP garage into Mill Road. Car Park at end. OS Ref NJ 779 193. 57.263529, -2.368746\n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/xu7817iv6SZmK8kv9\n\nNB Other info: The trail should not go through any fields with livestock, but there might be times when dogs should be on leads.\n\nOn Inn: Chez TRC, Sangara, Fullerton Farm, Thainstone AB51 0YR.\n\nGo back onto A96, south to Thainstone roundabout. Turn left to Kirkwood Commercial Park, turn right through gates. Park on the grass OS Ref NJ 781 182. \n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/FCAbh8vM2ZkyfuSQ8","street":"Elphinstone Road, AB51 5UD","cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr3rka7q004jjbhnktyljo2q","description":"On On:  Car park on south side of Slug Road about half way between Stonehaven & Crathes, near Rickarton AB39 3TE\n\nMap Ref: 56.994598, -2.345519    56°59'40.6\"N 2°20'43.9\"W  \n\nGooglemaps link - https://goo.gl/maps/CrfeimgToBJSZsNz8","street":"23 Scotstown Road, AB23 8HS","cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr3rkac6004ljbhnzjyt93i6","description":"NB Summer Time starts.  Don't forget to change your clocks - put them FORWARD one hour. Don't be late!!\n\nOn On: Insch Railway Station, off B9002.  \nGooglemaps link - https://maps.app.goo.gl/6z4oDiTEW1DqPeTb6?g_st=ic\n\nPerfect location for a beer afterwards, as you can get the train 😃  The 10:03 from Aberdeen gets in to Insch at 10:38 - perfect!\n\nThis Hash will cover some quite challenging terrain, so don’t wear shorts!! 🤪. It is a longish one at 4.75miles or 7.6km for you metric youngsters! 😆\nSome fields might have sheep with lambs.  If so, please keep all dogs on leads and don't stress them.\n\nOn Inn: chez Blagger. Please bring cash, as I will be raising money for Bennachie Leisure Centre - I am the treasurer of this community run facility, which is a registered charity. We no longer get funding from the Council and we are struggling to cover all our costs. \n\nThere will be soup & cake - bring your own beer (there’s a Coop in the village you’ll pass on the way from the station to my house 😊)\n\nOn Inn: 4 Simpson Brae, Insch AB52 6SZ\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/5yy76JrBn9hDMdfdA\n\n\nOn on!! 👣","street":"North Road, AB52 6XP","cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr3rkah3004njbhnxbd0uzkd","description":"OnOn: Potarch Green\nFrom A93 (North Deeside Rd) turn left over Potarch Bridge (B993).  Carpark on the Green to to left, opposite Potarch Hotel.\n\nGoogle Map: https://goo.gl/maps/iZWF7PUz4UnWndV18\n\nNote: Bon Accord Motorcycle club are using the carpark on the North side of the river.","street":"East Green, AB10, AB11","cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmr3rkali004pjbhn8qjj7sj1","description":"OnOn, from the juction of Cove Road with the Old Stonehaven Road.\nGoogle Map: https://goo.gl/maps/qTx1DeRx2AUswGPB9\n\nAs the Road is a dead end, to avoid difficulties at the end of the run, on arrival drive to the end and turn your car round and park facing the way you came in.,  \n\nDogs need to be under control as there are sheep in adjacent fields to run site and roads to cross.","street":"Stonehaven Road, AB10","cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
