{"id":"cmr3rkf50006njbhnk23zpz3n","description":"This year’s AH3  Xmas Party which, if you haven’t been paying attention, will be at the Inn At The Park, Deemount Terrace, Aberdeen AB11 7RX on the 16th  December, 2023:  7:00pm for food at 7:30pm.\n  \nCost is £34.00 per person which includes a 3 course meal, disco and some fun and games.                \n   \nAll drinks will be to individual accounts.\n\nPlease complete the sign -up form and pay for your evening using the account details below; please put XMAS and your hash handle in the reference so we know who has paid. Final numbers are needed by 4th December so please complete the form and pay your money by then.  \n\nThe Inn At The Park’s Christmas menu is attached for reference with fuller details of menu choices, Vegan options have already been arranged for as listed on the sign up form.\n\nThe dress theme for this year’s party is ‘Christmas Dinner’, so come dressed as anything you associate with Christmas Dinner or just come dressed for Christmas Dinner. There will be a prize for the best and maybe the worst. \n\nThere will be a disco after dinner, maybe some games and a secret Santa, so please bring a wrapped gender-neutral gift worth no more than £10 (no alcohol please). You can also put your craft skills to work and bring a homemade table decoration - no candles/ fireworks or other incendiary devices.\n\nFor those who with staying power, last orders will be 12:20 am and we will be thrown out at 1am.\n\nOn-On, \nShaky\n\nhttps://forms.gle/FkbtYowrk1KZ8TwL8\n\nE-Payment should be made to:\nABERDEEN HASH HOUSE HARRIERS\nBANK OF SCOTLAND\n80-12-06\n00100768","street":"3-4 Deemount Terrace, AB11 7RX","cost":"£3","clear_run":2104,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
