{"id":"cmr3rtirh0063yvhn4plzh5of","description":"To celebrate TNT's 40th Birthday we are kicking off the weekend with a Red Dress Run.\n\nPut on your Red Dress and meet at the Beehive Inn, In Edinburgh's Grass Market from 5.30pm onward, with the run itself starting around 6:30.\n\nIf it is sunny we have the garden (face the bar and head right), if not we will have a room set aside (likely to be upstairs).\n\nBring cash for one or two beer stops.\nYou can buy food from the bar, pay as you go, when we get back to the Beehive.\n\nWe are raising money for Leuchie House www.leuchiehouse.org.uk\nLeuchie House is based in North Berwick and provides short breaks for people with MS and other long-term conditions.\nIf you are registered for the entire weekend your £5 run charity donation is included. If not, we will collect £5 from you on the day.","street":"18 - 20 Grassmarket, EH1 2JU","cost":"£1","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
