{"id":"cmr3rva6p000x2phn13qx68gc","description":"Rego Price: 130 Euro\n\nRego Includes: Lodging, Beer/Wine, Dinner on Friday and Saturday, Breakfast and Lunch on Saturday and Sunday. A special gimmie, games, trail, and let us not forget End of Summer Debauchery!!!\n\nSlots Available: Only 65 lucky people get to participate!\n\nAgenda:\nFri, 12 Sep: Dinner and Drinks followed by a Cabin Pub Crawl\nSat, 13 Sep: Main trail (S, M, & L options), circle, and Hash Olympdics, followed by Evening Fun!!!\nSun, 14 Sep: Breakfast with a side of Saturday night’s regrets, then hangover trail, circle, and f*ck off.\n\nAccommodation Provided: https://www.stadtjugendring-pforzheim.de/jfs-lindelbrunn/anfahrt/\n\nThe following items are not provided; you must bring them:\n\n– Sleeping bags\n\n– Toilet paper\n\n– Pillow\n\n– Towel\n\nCABIN PUB CRAWL will have a very special twist this year! Sembach is looking to start making a “Special Drink” as part of our regular scheduled hashes, and that is where you come in!!!! Volunteer to have your cabin in the Pub Crawl. Each Cabin will make a drink that we can all try, and we will vote on the winner! The winner gets the honor of being the Creator of the Sembach Down Down Drink, PLUS you get to name it!","street":"Lindelbrunn 1","cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
