{"id":"cmr3rvcup00232phnbry14cxb","description":"Combined Green Dress Run Weekend for charity!!\n\nSponsored by Sembach, Stuttgart, Frankfurt, KRASH, DST, S H.I.T.S. and IOUH3 but not Altenglan.\nHere are the final details unless they change again...\n\nFriday night pay as you go Pub Crawl! Starting at 1800 at the Heidelberg Marriott!\n\nThere is no registration because we aren't providing anything but trails and pub crawls!\nFeel free to get a room for the weekend or train back and forth (you are an adult after all).\n\nIf you are going to stay the weekend, we recommend the DJH Youth Hostel or Heidelberg Marriott\nPlease invite all your friends! Hashers or not!\n\nWe will take donations all weekend long! The charity is the SOS Kinderdorf. https://www.sos-kinderdorf.de/","street":"Uferstraße 11, 69120","cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
