{"id":"cmr3rvt5q002n3mhn1za8p63o","description":"Catwoman and Prick Tweezer are the hares, and they say...\n\n    Only drop-off car parking at start point. If cycling from Edinburgh Park Station or other points in Edinburgh, the start is reached via a cycle underpass from Morrisons, South Gyle car park.\n\n    Trail is quiet roads, cycle paths and tracks.\n\n    There will be stops for coffee and cake, beer, and ice cream.\n\n    The On Inn has a bike rack and advises bringing your own bike lock\n\nNote the last point: you can't rely on using the On Inn's bike locks...","street":null,"cost":"£2","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
