{"id":"cmr58sveq001y04l516yrzi31","description":"Gin 'n' Vomit is the hare.\n\nTrail is just on 20 miles / 32km, ending up in a beer garden near a railway station.\n\nIf the weather is nice, there will be a picnic lunch stop en route, otherwise there will be a pub stop.\n\nStart point is the junction of the High Street and Cross Wynd (W3W ///Steer.value.menu) - beside Wetherspoon. It is about 10 minutes from Dunfermline City station.\n\nThe 10:21 from Edinburgh arrives at Dunfermline City at 10:51.\nThe previous train (09:49) arrives at 10:23. Anyone travelling on this train would get to the start point in time to visit one of the nearby cafes or other places to buy stuff for lunch.","street":null,"cost":"£2","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
