{"id":"cmr8gfdvn0009qthnksm9p0zl","description":"The FISHHH proudly presents \"Harey Cherries A'Poppin'\"\n \nDecember 18, 12:00 Noon\n\nThe Event:\nSanjia Park\nBeer arrives: 11:45\nChalk Talk: 12:15\nHares Away: 12:30\nBathroom: yes\nYouBike: yes\nTrain/Bus: 10 minute walk from Taiyuan Station \n\nCourse:\nA to A\nFlat Terrain\nWalkers 7.1km\nRunners 9.9km\nSplits:2\nBeer Check: 1\nChildren: supervised\nStrollers: not recommended \nDogs: sure\nURBAN hash. expect traffic and street crossings \n\nAre you nothing but a hound dog? Are you crying all the time? Have you never caught a rabbit (or hare)? \nWell, we've got news for you! Now's your big chance because hares Anywhere But My Shoes and Frog Fucker have no idea what the Hell they're doing! Neither has ever done this before.\nHaving your name recorded in the annals of Hash lore will never be this easy again as we explore the urban neighborhoods, nooks and crannies of Taichung's East and Taiping districts. ON ON\nSanjia Park\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/gdZrKvCRomYPvGRq7","street":null,"cost":"NT$ 250","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
