{"id":"cmr8gfekl000jqthnsub88mx0","description":"Hares away at 00:01 !!! $0 FREE $0\nCome join us for a very special trail of lurking in the shadows as you bumble your way around urban Fengyuan.\nThere is no run fee for this (but donations welcome 😉 ) as it is BYOB: bring/buy your own booze. We will be starting/passing/finishing near a multitude of convenience stores. Your thirst will be sated.\nLeave the kids and the car at home, but bring your YoyoKa, this late night jaunt is A-to-B, with Youbikes near the finish to get you gone. (or buses if you wait long enough).\nWe'll update you on the exact start closer to the event day, but you should aim for the Fengyuan Train Station area around 11 pm on Saturday night. \n**WEATHER PERMITTING ** If we get heavy rain, this will be postponed.","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
