{"id":"cmre7ikkw000jvihnnxwzmo61","description":"HHHi Halfminds,\n\nWe all know technology is not made for trail, so don't let the hare fool you with the name of the starting point... shiggy there shall be! \n\n\nWhen : Sunday 18th May at 14:00 \n\nWhere : Tram stop \"Parc Technologique\" in St Priest - Tram line T2 \nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/mMUUyRf1ByZDZsTT7 \n\nHow to get there : Take tram T2 in the direction of St Priest Bel Air\n\nHare : Hidden Asset\nHashcash : 5€\nBagdrop : Not really, but if you insist, we'll stash your stuff in the nearby bushes...","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ikpt000lvihnkapfx8nz","description":"Let's celebrate the 69th day of Lazy Cola.\nAn evening run (at 6.9pm)\nHare: Lazy Swinger\nMeeting point : the gym, on the quays in Front of Hospital St Jean St Luc\nMore details to come","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ile2000nvihni8y1o2kj","description":"Lyon H3 Run #12 - A French man went to...the Lac de Miribel\n\n📆When : Monday 14th July at 10am \n\n🗺Where : In front of the public toilets ,\n plage du Morlet, Allée du Morlet, 69120 Vaulx-en-Velin  \nBetween Brasserie du Grand Parc and Parking de la Capitainerie \nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/tCjmBjgUSJuV4LtG6 \n\n🚍How to get there : \nTake bus N83 from Métro Laurent Bonnevay or bus N80 from Métro Vaulx en Velin la Soie. Stop at \"Grand parc le Morlet\" and walk 1 minute to the start. Bus every 20 min\nOr bike it, along the Rhône\nCars : plenty car parks around\n\n🐰Hare : You Chew Mine\n\n💸Hashcash : 5€\n\n🎒Bagdrop : probably\n \n👙Swimstop : yes! get ready to be wet \n \n🍱On after : we will do a picnic after the run, either by buying asian food from the street vendors (if they are around on that day) or from the local guinguette / frite house. This is pay as you go. You can also bring your own food.\nAnd we will hang out by the lake afterwards...","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ilj2000pvihnwugz23xf","description":"It's August, the town is empty, all the lyonnais are away on vacation... all?? no, a few irreductible hashers are still bravely battling with the heat, quenching their thirst with every single beer they might lay their hands on!\n\nAnd that's a good coïncidence, since we have visitors next week, Sleeping Booty from Paris and Bl*w Job from Australia. Yes, sounds like the start of a very hashy fairy tale. Wanna know the end of the story?\n\nCome and join us for a short(ish) trail - said the hare - and some drinking practice afterwards!","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ilom000rvihntmt9e4hx","description":"Here a mix of our two last trails, one where much water (from the sky!) and swimming in a lake was involved and the other one about fairy tales... , so that some of us might have turned into frogs already! \n\nWell, next trail won't be far from the water either, and the hare promissed us forest and knights of the round table... or at least a table, and frogs... will those poor frogs end up on the knights roundtable? or just on the hashers' plates?\n\n\nHere the details:\n\nWhen : Saturday 30th August at 2pm \n\nWhere : In front of Vernaison train station \nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/gFupSUKyPVfwkGSQ9  \n \nHow to get there : \nFrom Lyon Perrache station, take the 13:31 train in the direction of Firminy.\nIt's only a 15min train ride to Vernaison, BUT, there is a train every hour only. Don't miss it! \n\nHare : Hidden Asset\n\nHashcash : 5€\n\nBagdrop : probably?\n \nOn after (or On before?) : The local resto (L'île) is supposed to be renowned for its Froglegs... let's see what we can disorganise","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7iltb000tvihnszy9ghjc","description":"HHHey Halfminds,\n\nIt's been a year already for Lyon H3. Hashy Beer Day as we say! Let's celebrate by ... raiding the wine fair!!\n\nWhat to expect? Lyon H3 at its best cheapest : a short-ish last minute trail in a dirty urban area, may be no beer stop, probably little drinks at circle, no logo, no T-shirt nor celebratory haberdash... but free entrance to the Salon des vignerons indépendants and all you can drink wine, bubbly, schnaps at the on-after!! \n\nHere the details :\n\n📆 When : Sunday November 2nd at 11:00 am\n\n🗺️ Where : At tram stop \"Tony Garnier\" , 4 Rue Jonas Salk, 69007 Lyon\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/AyKU9gLFWPX8zta47 \n \n🚃 How to get there : \nTram T1, stop \"Halle Tony Garnier\" \n\n🐇Hare : Hidden Asset\n\n💸Hashcash : 5€\n\n🎒Bagdrop : probably not\n \n🍷On after : At about 13:00, we will go the the wine fair (Salon des Vignerons indépendants), where you get a wine glass, and then can wander around (no trail marked!) and taste wine, but also bubbly, liqueurs, etc... \n👉Get your free entrance ticket here : https://www.belles-graves.com/invitation-salon-des-vins-de-lyon-htg-2025/ \nThere are also food stands where you can buy food.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ilzg000vvihncxol9qpv","description":"A city center hangover trail, for all those overachievers that ran the Beaujolais Wine marathon the day before.\n\nHere the details :\n\nWhen : Sunday 23. November 2026, at 12:00\n\nWhere : Entrance of Parc de la Tête d'Or (49 Boulevard des Belges/Rue Tête d'Or) - This is not the main entrance!\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/TGhpNcmXhhxaZ7xA6\n\nHow to get there from Part-Dieu train station: 10 min bus ride (line C1 or C6). Or 2km walk. Or Massena metro station (Line A) and 15 min walk\nHare : Sir Slack Mac\nHashcash : 5€\nBagdrop : probably not a big one. Leave your heavy shit at home\n\n On after : Probably.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7im4h000xvihnf9xxoo8v","description":"HoHoHo Halfminds,\n\nHave you written your letter to Santa yet? \nIf not, don't bother, hashers are usually too naughty to get anything nice...  What??!  No, don't deny it! I already have a list of down-downs as long as a ballbreaker trail ready for next circle.\n\nBut this shouldn't stop you to come and join us for a Christmassy run in Lyon city center!\n\n \n\nHere the details :\n\nWhen : Sunday 14. December 2025, at 14:00\n\nWhere : Place Bellecour, north-east corner. In front of the Crédit Mutuel, 15 place Bellecour \n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/Dz1ErdehrQzFPKxu7\n\nHare : NegliJected + Just Nadège\n\nHashcash : 5€ + bring your own €€ for spontaneus mulled wine stops\n\nBagdrop : probably not, carry your own shite\nWhat: It's Christmas, please wear appropriate green or red hashgear, your best Santa outfit or your uggliest Christmas Jumper! 🧑‍🎄\n\nOn after : Probably more mulled wine and Christmas market shenanigans.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7imak000zvihn8c028xqh","description":"HHHi Halfminds,\n\nFor once Lyon H3 is well ahead (who said head?) of time!\nHashmas and New Beer are not even over yet, and we are already talking about the next set of festivities : the galette des rois!  Yes, Just Lilah has promessed us some sweet stuff at the end of the trail!\nLet's drop that Dry January trend, and come eat cake with us! \n\n \n\nHere the details for next run :\n\nWhen : Sunday 18. January 2025, at 14:00\n\nWhere : Aire de jeu Moncey, at the corner Rue Moncey/Rue Denoir, Lyon 3\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/9V3nGMPzZWByzL9b8  \n\nHow to get there: Metro line B stop Place Guichard-Bourse du Travail , Tram line T1 stop Palais de Justice or Auditorium\n\nHare : Just Lilah (and her little helpers)\n\nHashcash : 5€ \n\nBagdrop : yes\nWhat/On after : Yes, there will be some galette des rois cake at the circle!","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7imfw0011vihnvtv2g46c","description":"The weather outside will probably be crappy, our hare might drag us into creepy areas, the trail will be crap, but... there will be crêpes at the end! \nThat is ... if you survive another You Chew Mine run in the Parc de Parilly....\n \n \n\nHere the details for next run :\n\nWhen : Sunday 22. February 2026, at 14:00\n\nWhere : In front of the Pharmacy Viviani, 68 avenue Viviani, Vénissieux \n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/C5PNKmfbKcuXiAqT7 \nHow to get there: Tram line T4, stop Etats-Unis Viviani \n\nHare : You Chew Mine\n\nHashcash : 5€ \n\nBagdrop : yes\nWhat/On after : Yes, there will be some crêpes at the circle","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7imkm0013vihngeglo53a","description":"HHHi Halfminds,\nGalette at the January run, Crêpes for our February hash, and now a trail set on pi day (03/14)... is this group slowly turning into Cake H3 ??\n Lazy Swinger, our hare in March insisted it has nothing to do with pastries or being sweet, he is just a bit premature ... ly celebrating St Patrick's Day!\nSo yes, expect another epic trail from pub to pub, maybe a bit of running in between, hashmarkings in form of clovers, and leprechauns galore! \n \n\nHere the details for next run :\nWhen : SATURDAY 14. March 2026 at 14:00 \nWhere : Place Bellecour, north-east corner. In front of the Crédit Mutuel, 15 place Bellecour \nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/Dz1ErdehrQzFPKxu7\nHow to get there : Metro stop Bellecour\nHares : Lazy Swinger (+ Just Vid as not to be trusted co-hare)\nHashcash : 5€ + bring your own €€ for spontaneus pub stops\nBagdrop : no\nThis will be an A to B trail (we don't come back to the starting point)\nDress code : wear green or something Irish, or something sweet as a pie","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7impf0015vihnchzuzsg6","description":"HHHi Halfminds,\nEaster is a\"Ronde\" the corner, and our hare might have mistaken the Easter bunnies with Easter Pussies... whatever, both kinds are soft and fluffy.\nNot sure there will be Eastereggs checks on trail, but you'll for sure be spinned \"Ronde\", baby, right \"Ronde\" !\n \n\nHere the details for next run :\nWhen : SATURDAY 4. April 2026 at 14:00 \nWhere : Place Ronde - Montchat, \nIn front of the Crédit Agricole, 55 Cours Richard-Vitton, Lyon\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/FSFTKjMGCyyGcoum6 \n\nHow to get there : Tram T3 or T6, stop \"gare de Villeurbanne\" or bus C9, C26, ... to \"Montchat - Place Ronde\" \nHares : Neglijected + co-hare Hidden Asset\nHashcash : 5€\nBagdrop : no\nThis will be an A to B trail (we don't come back to the starting point) - B is about 10 min walk from A\nDress code : Easter hares and pussies ?","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7imu20017vihn8oz029q9","description":"Saturday April 25th, 12:00 (time TBC), Lyon Beer festival, in La Doua. Followed by a visit to the beer festival","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7imyq0019vihnbcxyisaf","description":"HHHi Halfminds,\nThe weather outside is ... delightful, so no need to give it a blow, let's grill them sausages! \nBut before that, the hare plans on dragging you through the urban maze of Villeurbane/Vaulx en Velin. Be ready to eat some concrete before ending up in Just Like Me's hidden garden for some juicy meat.\nSince we are doing a little BBQ afterwards, this week's hashcash will be 10€. Please also bring  a side dish, salad, dessert or a bottle. Sausages will be provided by our lovely hostess.\n \nHere some useful/less info about next run :\nWhen : SUNDAY May 3rd at 14:00\n\nWhere : In front of Ninkasi La Soie, 34 Rue de la Soie, 69100 Villeurbanne \nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/HjxPRerc5a2HZorF9 \n\nHow to get there : Metro A, or tram 3 or 7, stop \"Vaulx en Velin La Soie\"\n\nHares : Just Like Me (+ Hidden Asset)\n \nHashcash : 10€\n \nBagdrop : yes, we'll have a car to drop your shite in (and put the dishes somewhere cool)\n \nA to B trail (B is 20 min walk from A, or 10 min to next tram stop)\n \nOn-After : Just Like Me is welcoming us in her garden to grill a few sausages. Please bring a side dish, salad, dessert or a bottle. You'll be able to drop this in the hashcar at the start of the run.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7in3a001bvihn2jxe398t","description":"HHHi Halfminds,\nThe month of May is full of \"holes\" and long weekends, but the June hash is so far away that we needed to squeeze one in between. \nThe Swinger family will soon move to the hills of Sainte Foy lès Lyon, so let's get up there and check out their new hood!\n \nHere some useful/less info about next run :\n\nWhen : SATURDAY May 23rd at 14:00\n\nWhere : Bus stop \"Plan du Loup - Les Razes\" in Sainte Foy lès Lyon (corner Chemin du plan du Loup with Chemin des Razes\n\nHow to get there : Take bus C19 from Lyon Perrache. Every 20 min\n\n\nHare : Lazy Swinger\n \nHashcash : 5€\n \nBagdrop : probably not, carry your own shite\n \nA to B trail : public transportation will be available at B\n \nOn-After : Maybe... Probably...","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7inb2001dvihnpr8axhjm","description":"HHHi Halfminds,\n\nAs you might be aware off, a few of the most racist members of this group regularly meet in the early morning to go for a r#n followed by coffee. Our hare this time will use the usual starting point of this horrible morning habit, and try to convert it into a proper beer quest, as it should be.\n\nHere some useful/less info about next run :\n\nWhen : Sunday June 14th at 14:00\n\nWhere : At the footbridge \"Passerelle du collège\", accross 1 rue Bugeaud, 69006 Lyon\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/7KWksdLkJomTSwQSA \n\nHow to get there : it's in the city center, just check out the fastest route yourself you lazzy b#st#rds\n\nHare : Just Lilah\n \nHashcash : 5€\n \nBagdrop : no, carry your own shite\n \nA to B trail : public transportation will be available at B\n \nOn-After : Maybe...","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7iwq90001wfhno0izcx6y","description":"It all started with a rumor comming from the north and spread by Dancing Queen, of all those ships gathering in Sète end of March... Hearing that siren call, the local viking hashers couldn´t help but rally more Swedes for a long awaited gathering of the Héraultics H3.\n\nIf you checked the date, it will all sound a bit fishy to you, but here is the plan : \n\nOur hare will set a (rather walking) trail from the train station to a pub in the harbour area. We will have the opportunity to enjoy the last day of maritime festival Escale à Sète, with the tall ships departing on that day.","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7iwuq0003wfhnv889kt6z","description":"Hangover run\nHéraultics Hashers seem to have a tendency to randomly gather in the weirdest place... so why the Hell not set a trail while there  together?! \n\nThe occasion this time is the joint Toulouse and Hamburg hash organised in Helgoland, a tiny island off the coast of Germany. Yes, the boat franzy from our last trail seems to still be there","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7iwyx0005wfhnf30npvbz","description":"Let's 2025 beging with discovering some new hash territory for the Héraultics H3.\n\nThe old town of Agde will welcome our first trail of the year.\n\n \n\nHere the info :\n\nWhen : Saturday February 8th, at 15:00\n\nWhere : In front of 25 rue d'Embonne, 34300 Agde\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/TBtQmWnLX482zeV3A\n\nHow to get there : 10 minutes walk from Agde train station\n\nHare : John Cleese + Horny Tail\n\nHashcash : 5€\n\nBag drop : yes\n\nOn-After : we might be allowed in by the hares, who offered to \"fix some food and beer\" \n\n(And some crashspace could be available for those wanting to spend the night over)\n\nFacebook event : https://www.facebook.com/events/1109714857306791/","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ix3t0007wfhnejcvoz9t","description":"Save the date for next Héraultics H3 trail in Montpellier!\n\nMore details to come closer to the date, but here the main info:\n \nWhen : Sunday June 8th, at 14:00\n\nWhere : At the tram stop \"Via Domitia\" in Montpellier\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/nWSYnfvoiPquEDmn6 \n\nHow to get there : 25 minutes tram ride from Montpellier Saint Roch train station (tram line T2). There is a big TaM carpark if you come by car.\n\nHare : HungJury + Ringburner\n\nHashcash : 5€\n\nBag drop : maybe\n\nOn-After : probably\n\nPrelube : A pub-crawl in Montpellier the night before is being disorganised. More info to come closer to the date","street":null,"cost":"€5","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ix8v0009wfhn99h5pocm","description":"Join the Héraultics H3 as they travel over the sea once again. Horns and vessels? Horny on the vessel?\nWe are as confused as you are.\n\nThe Heraultics HHH proudly presents the on-vessel trail.\nStart Thursday March 5th at 22:30 from just outside the buffet restaurant from\nViking Line M/S Viking Glory, from Stockholm to Turku.\nJohn Cleese our hare even promissed a beer stop...","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7ixds000bwfhnvkxkdinq","description":"The Héraultics H3 and the Toulouse H3 have the privilege to hare the fabulous hangover trail for the Diva H3 Bubbly weekend in Carcassonne!\n \nThis sparkling trail will (probably?) take you through the lanes of the mediaval city, looking for Blanquette de Limoux, the local bubbly! Also this occasion to discover a fantastic group of Divas, Toyboys and SuggarDaddies!\n\nPlease RSVP if you plan on joining the Diva H3 on that hangover trail.\n\nWhen : Sunday April 19th at 10:00, for first tasting and chalk-talk at 10:30\n\nWhere :  meeting in front of the Tribe Hotel, 2 rue des 3 couronnes in Carcassonne\n\nOn-After : Finish the bubbles and go visit the town","street":null,"cost":"€10","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmre7j6o70001x4hnmm27t9jq","description":"Well we gotta start somewhere.\nWhere : Steinwenden Train Station\nWhen: 1 May 2024 1815\nCost: BYOB, we will have coolers and a beer wagon\nHares: But His Nut and Better Laid Than Never AKA BetterNut\nTrail Description: Just under 3 miles, A-A+. Circle location will be a BeirGarten with options for food. Weather permitting outside, if not...inside 🙂\nHARES AWAY: NLT than 1830!!!!!!\nAnswers to questions from the Hares:\nBeer wagon = it's a car, drinks and stuff will be taken to the A+ for you\nBYOB = Bring Your Own Beverages, INCLUDING trail drinks. No Beverage Stop on trail tonight\nRun/Walk Option = YES, there will be a *unners/Walkers Trail. Just under 2 miles for walkers, right at 3 miles for *unners\nDo I need money = Only if you want to partake in food/beverages at the On-After.\nOn-After = Yes, we will end at a place that has food/beverage options.","street":"Bahnhofstrasse 2","cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
