{"id":"cmro87ree000604l4he0ws6tg","description":"Come and enjoy some more town based heat by meeting us at the Salisbury Ale House for a social trek around the highways and byways of Manchester city centre. \n\nOur hare, Beer Sniffer, is hot to trot - so come on down and have some fun!\n\nMeet at the Salisbury around 18:00, on-out around 18:30. All welcome!","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmro87rfg000804l4fi3ziatc","description":"Here's a sneaky little Thursday evening Hash for you that we've added just because we can!\n\nFor this hash we will be joined by the Mersey Thirstday Hash (Merseythirstdayshash.com) who are travelling over from the wilds of Liverpool to hash in our manor. Clearly this incursion cannot be let to happen without a good showing from MH3 members, so please come along if you can!\n\nThis will be an A to B hash, where we start at one pub and end at another. Never fear though, there will be transport back to A from B at the end. The hash will be around 5K, and suitable for runners, walkers and dogs too.\n\nThe has will begin at 7pm (or thereabouts), and we will arrange to car-pool given the location of the hash. The start point is the Rivington Brewery Company tap (https://www.rivingtonbrewing.co.uk/) and we're likely to end up at the Blackedge Brewery Bar which is just up the road from The Crown for those of you who have hashed with us from this location before.","street":null,"cost":null,"clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmro87rgb000a04l43a5puz33","description":"Come one and all to sunny Stockport. Our hares for the day are Horny Devil and Beer Sniffer, and we're sure to get more than a whiff of beer if they have anything to do with it.\n\nWe're meeting at the Jolly Sailor, and then traipsing around Davenport and surrounding areas on the hunt for a beer stop, or maybe two. Expect the trail to be part urban and part off piste. The pub is dog friendly and if you're peckish it has a wide menu, with plenty of veggie/vegan & gluten free options too.\n\nMeet from 14:00, on-out at 14:30.\n\nSubs: £3 for regulars, free for first timers and kids.","street":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
