{"id":"cmrtw3osn001q04l4kual8655","description":"BHHH2 Run 2313: Gedung BHHH2 Panorama, Lembang\n\nWhen: Friday, 24 Juli 2026\nRun Start: 2:30pm sharp local time\nTips: Arrive well beforehand to prepare for run, buy Run Fee\n\nWhere: Gedung BHHH2, Komplek Panorama Indah, Lembang\nGmaps keyword search: Gedung BHHH2\n\nHares: Dini & Fei\nRun Options: Short (4km), Medium (7km), Long (10km)\n\nTicketing Team: Ie Mey, Ay Chen, Unuy (Group IV)\nRun Fee: Rp15.000 under 40 y.o, Rp25.000 over 40 y.o\n\nWhen on the run, please keep in mind:\n- Do not step on, stomp on, or pick up any fruits, crops nor vegetables - they belong to someone\n- Refrain from being noisy around places of worship\n- Do not forget to buy your Run Fee!","street":null,"cost":"Rp 25,000","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
