{"id":"cmt6h1zhw001g04icnsl5flj4","description":"BHHH2 Run 2318: Gedung BHHH2 Panorama, Lembang\n\nWhen: Friday, 28 August 2026\nRun Start: 3:00pm sharp local time\nTips: Arrive well beforehand to prepare for run, buy Run Fee\n\nWhere: Gedung BHHH2, Komplek Panorama Indah, Lembang\nGmaps keyword search: Gedung BHHH2\n\nHares: Upey & Untung\nRun Options: Short (4km), Medium (7km), Long (10km)\n\nTicketing Team: Ie Mey, Aychen, Unuy (Group IV)\nRun Fee: Rp15.000 under 40 y.o, Rp25.000 over 40 y.o\n\nWhen on the run, please keep in mind:\n- Do not step on, stomp on, or pick up any fruits, crops nor vegetables - they belong to someone\n- Refrain from being noisy around places of worship\n- Do not forget to buy your Run Fee!","street":null,"cost":"Rp 25,000","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmt7wj0hp001b04kvtolbsdcy","description":"We're taking our sad group of Belgrade Hashers up to Novi Sad for the day. We will meet at the Belgrade Prokup main train station on Saturday 29th at 11:30am.  Then we can decide if we want the fast 'Soko' train of 33 minutes, or the regular slow train of 50 minutes - which gives us more time to drink on the train.\n\nWhen we arrive in Novi Sad, we'll actually be at Petrovaradin. Gary Fists Patrick will live hare from there to Novi Sad. Or we can take the bus to the center and GFP will live hare from there.  This is a very 'polako' Hash as they say here.\n\nIt's an A to B trail with 3 beer stops and a on-after dinner.  Runners and walkers are together, and probably everyone will walk if the temperature is above 35 degrees. Then we hustle back to Belgrade, unless some sad people get stuck in Novi Sad.","street":null,"cost":"RSD 350","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
