{"id":"cmu943f1r001705lacfza1u7t","description":"This will be a LIVE trail starting at the Praca General Osorio park, with your hare ROMEO. The pack will give the hare a 5 minute head start before they are let lose and hunt him down like the dirty hounds that they are.    The run will be A to whatever!!   if you come you will find out...!!!\n\n\nDirections: The meeting point is in the center of the Praça General Osório in front of the fountain, close to Metro Station Exit A,. For an image view of the exactly meeting point, just copy and paste ( -22.9851939,-43.1977855 ) at googlemaps or just CLICK HERE .\n\n\nHow to get there:  Whatever, follow these details:\nTrain - Catch ANY Metro in Rio that goes south , make sure you get General Osorio Station...  it is there, take the exit that leads to the Praça... or..\nTaxi -   Flag down a taxi and ask the driver to take you to General Osorio Metro Station.... or ......\nBy Bus, Taxi, Walking, Runnning, Swimming, Flying.. it´s up to you!!!!!!!!!! Everyone knows where Ipanema is, specially General Osorio, so just ask anyone.   Just be there on time.\n\n\n\nCosts: Normal \"Non-Food Hash”, charge for all the grog:\n= R$30 for normal hashers\n= R$ 15 for abnormal hashers (those who does not drink alcohol) \n= SPROGS pays R$ 353.50, but unfortunately are not allowed, except if they come with cash and then, what the heck, they are welcomed…","street":null,"cost":"R$30","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
