{"id":"cmv09i6xh002y04jkus0uhk6z","description":"Our hare BITW invites you and yours to a travail around Broadbottom. I'm sure there's a joke in there somewhere, but it's far too early for that sort of nonsense.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: We have a non-standard start time. Beano - beware! We are meeting from 13:00, not the usual 14:00. \n\nExpect some shiggy, depending on the weather, so dress appropriately. The nearest station is Broadbottom, and if coming by car there is street parking nearby.\n\n£3 for regulars, free for first timers and kids. Dogs welcome naturally!","street":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmv09i6yw003004jklttcjvh9","description":"For our first hash of October, Beano will be leading us on a crooked run.\n\nThe venue is The Crooked Man in Prestwich, and as usual we'll meet at 14:00 for a 14:30 start. There is parking fairly close by if you're driving, and plenty of free parking at the Prestwich Metro which is 5 minutes away. For anyone arriving by bus, the 95, 97, 98 and 99 services all stop nearby.\n\nSubs: £3 for regulars, free for first timers and kids.","street":null,"cost":"£3","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
{"id":"cmv1mtbmp002e05jww7oe90s3","description":"ON ON, Hashers‼️‼️‼️\n*Next Weekly Wednesday Run with the Sierra Hash House Harriers and Harriettes is a Normal RUN!!!\n🏃🏾‍♂️🏃🏽‍♀️🏃🏾‍♂️🏃🏽‍♀️🏃🏾‍♂️🏃🏽‍♀️🏃🏾‍♂️🏃🏽‍♀️🏃🏾‍♂️🏃🏽‍♀️🏃🏾‍♂️🏃🏽‍♀️\n\nWHAT TO BRING\n•⁠  ⁠✅ Hash T-shirt \n•⁠  ⁠⁠✅Your Trail Sneaker Hash\n•⁠  ⁠⁠✅ Hash Gear (No flip-flops)\n\nHouse Rules ya wankers👇\n•⁠  ⁠❌ NO unauthorized virgins – If Mismanagement hasn’t anointed you, don’t show up\n•⁠  ⁠❌ NO paparazzi – Trail shame stays on trail 📸🚫\n•⁠  ⁠❌ NO outside food – Mismanagement has spoken! 🍔\n\nREMEMBER\nNo pain, no gain... and then more pain... followed by buckets of beer. 🍻 Lube those knees, suck it up, and show up. 💪\n\nON ON!\nGM Fuckimbo 🕶️🔥","street":"Rokel MD’s residence, Hill Station","cost":"SLL 30","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
