{"id":"cmva9jkem002404l6cftv411k","description":"WHAT: Hash R*n # 453\r\nWHERE: Lapa - Rio de Janeiro\r\nWHEN:  Saturday , October, 17 – 2026\r\nTIME: 3:00pm\r\nHARE: Romeo  & Not That Hot\r\n\r\nDirections:  The meeting point is under the Arcos da Lapa at center of square by the Arches \r\nHow to get there:\r\nTrain - Catch ANY Metro in Rio, make sure you get Cinelandia Metro Station... once you are in the streets you are about two blocks of the Arches.\r\nFor an image view of the exactly meeting point, just copy and paste (-22.912889, -43.179583 ) \n\r\nTaxi -   Flag down a taxi and ask the driver to take you to Arcos da Lapa.... or ......\r\n\r\nBy Bus, Walking, Runnning, Swimming, Flying.. \r\nIt´s up to you!!!!!!!!!!     Just be there on time.\r\nHash Insight:  The hash will be A to B and B its not far from A. If you cum you will find out...!!!\r\n \r\nIf you are late, follow the trail…  \r\n \r\nCosts: Normal \"Non-Food Hash”, charge for all the grog:\r\n= R$30 for normal hashers\r\n= R$ 15 for abnormal hashers (those who does not drink alcohol) \r\n= SPROGS pays R$ 353.50, but unfortunately are not allowed, except if they come with cash and then, what the heck, they are welcomed… \r\n \r\nThis will be theBEST Lapa HASH  EVER!","street":null,"cost":"R$30","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
