{"id":"cmw50n5260009ilhnszmvv1cr","description":"We had a beer stop here back in September and the friendly landlord was keen to welcome us again. Although they don't normally do food on a Sunday, they will open their kitchen for us, so we're hoping for a good turnout to make it worth their while. You can find their menu on their website here: https://commercialpub.co.uk/ \n\nThe pub does not have a car park; it's street parking only. Currently there are roadworks right outside, but there's plenty of parking in nearby side streets.","street":null,"cost":"£1.50","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
