{"id":"cmw50p40d000p2shngm2o77su","description":"Dear hashers,\nYou are specially and specifically invited to witness this GRAND EVENT - The Abuja Hash House Harriers Silver Jubilee & Handover.\nThis attractive and desirable kennel has been running on beer since *November 1997*, with this year making it 25 years on rugged trails in search of the epic Bush.\nThis event shall be nothing less than a RAVE - be advised.\nDate: 25-27th November, 2022\nRego: N10,000 only\nVenue: Aaliyah Royal Hotel & Suites, Dawaki.\nAll payments to: FCMB [redacted].\nSend evidence to Hash Cash *08054633184*\nSend Tshirt size to Haberdasher *08068862365*\n\nE go loud ooo, do not miss this one!\nCum, see and feel the nation's capital as we go after the elusive hare!\n🔛 🔛 👣 👣 🍻 🍻","street":null,"cost":"NGN 10,000","clear_run":null,"old_title":null,"title":null,"clear_time":false},
